{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"db0c2f75408a2b23","type":"text","text":"**Key Message**\nTrans people deserve tools, language, and spaces that are created with them in mind, not simply adapted for them after the fact.","x":334,"y":-172,"width":634,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"4e86628d0c38f503","type":"text","text":"**Core Purpose**\n- Affirm and support trans people\n- Create a product that speaks directly to a smaller, underserved community\n- Provide resources beyond the planner\n- Help trans people feel thought about and cared for\n- Inspire confidence, comfort, and self-acceptance","x":334,"y":-42,"width":446,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"525dd4f2d9309781","type":"text","text":"**Audience**\n- Trans adults\n- Trans youth\n- Parents and families of trans kids\n- LGBTQ+ community organizations\n- Allies\n- Schools, nonprofits, and resource groups","x":340,"y":280,"width":434,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"6d8c196c51bf8ede","type":"text","text":"### Call to Actions\n- Purchase or use the planner\n- Follow social media for resources\n- Learn how to support the trans community\n- Share resources with trans youth and families\n- Attend or promote workshops\n- Engage with name change resources and community support","x":874,"y":-37,"width":519,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6a3d6fa5ef639966","type":"text","text":"**Content Suggestions**\n- Affirmation posts\n- Planner page previews\n- Trans resource guides\n- Name change workshop information\n- Support tips for allies\n- Community resource spotlights\n- Stories of affirmation and identity\n- Mental wellness and self-reflection prompts","x":1500,"y":-70,"width":463,"height":317,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"3e6dd28ac78a7e92","type":"text","text":"# Transcend\n","x":114,"y":-32,"width":181,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0ac9933e8f218843","type":"text","text":"# Core Theme\nA community-centered creative ecosystem using music, wellness, and affirming resources to help people feel seen, supported, inspired, and connected.","x":-1000,"y":-323,"width":329,"height":203},
		{"id":"0b350b4fcbc15432","type":"text","text":"# Unifying Messaging\nEach project creates access, representation, and care for underrepresented communities through culture, health, education, and self-expression.","x":-1000,"y":-70,"width":325,"height":203},
		{"id":"d712cd58d3853fd9","type":"text","text":"# Dai's Brand Ecosystem","x":-640,"y":-67,"width":233,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"72cfb4e3ff91bff5","type":"text","text":"**Audience**\n- Music lovers\n- Queer communities\n- Underground music fans\n- Event organizers\n- Artists and creatives\n- People interested in music education and discovery","x":363,"y":-492,"width":400,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"17151b951ae241a8","type":"text","text":"### Call to Actions\n- Listen to the catalogue\n- Book DJ services\n- Explore underground and queer artists\n- Attend events\n- Support the community\n- Deepen their understanding of music and other people","x":863,"y":-810,"width":519,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fe42627b61acb8b4","type":"text","text":"**Content Suggestions**\n- Artist spotlights\n- Queer and underground music recommendations\n- DJ set clips\n- Music education posts\n- Event recaps\n- “Songs you should know” series\n- Behind-the-scenes of production or performance","x":1523,"y":-822,"width":463,"height":275,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ec593af446424af0","type":"text","text":"**Key Message**\nMusic is more than entertainment. It is a tool for connection, education, representation, and community-building.","x":363,"y":-960,"width":634,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"83ed50a6eb424395","type":"text","text":"**Core Purpose**\n- Give underrepresented artists a platform\n- Share underground and queer music\n- Inspire people to explore music more deeply\n- Build community through sound, education, and shared experiences","x":363,"y":-815,"width":400,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a6982629e4c9592c","type":"text","text":"# Music Services\n","x":114,"y":-810,"width":181,"height":50,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"be15c37a21e22c3c","x":-360,"y":-172,"width":409,"height":692,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"**COMMUNITY**\nEach project is built around supporting people, especially underrepresented communities.\n\n**REPRESENTATION**\nThe work gives visibility to queer, trans, underground, creative, and wellness-focused communities.\n\n**EDUCATION**\nEach brand teaches something: music discovery, personal nutrition, or community support.\n\n**ACCESS**\nThe brands help people access things they may not normally find easily: music platforms, healthier foods, affirming resources, and supportive spaces.\n\n**WELLNESS**\nWellness appears in different forms across the ecosystem: emotional wellness, physical wellness, cultural wellness, and community wellness.\n\n**SELF-EXPRESSION**\nMusic, food, identity, and creativity are all ways people express who they are."}
	],
